flowchart TB
  Goal[用户目标] --> Plan[Orchestrator 生成计划]
  Plan --> Select{选择专业 Agent}
  Select -->|含学习依赖| Seq[串行执行]
  Select -->|无依赖| Par[并行执行]
  Seq --> Atlas[Atlas]
  Par --> Atlas
  Seq --> Mira[Mira]
  Par --> Mira
  Seq --> Nova[Nova]
  Par --> Nova
  Atlas --> Bus[(Message Bus)]
  Mira --> Bus
  Nova --> Bus
  Atlas --> Mem[(Shared Memory)]
  Mira --> Mem
  Nova --> Mem
  Bus --> Merge[Orchestrator 合并]
  Mem --> Merge
  Atlas -.handoff.-> Mira
  Mira -.handoff.-> Nova
  Merge --> Conflict{存在冲突?}
  Conflict -->|是| Resolve[标注来源并调和]
  Conflict -->|否| Result[最终方案]
  Resolve --> Result
  Result --> Risk{高影响动作?}
  Risk -->|是| Confirm[等待用户确认]
  Risk -->|否| Done[完成]
  Confirm -->|批准| Apply[工具层执行]
  Confirm -->|拒绝| Done
  Apply --> Done
  Merge --> Trace[(Run Repository 持久化)]
